flowchart TD
    Start[User requests TraceAPL page] --> Session{Valid session?}
    Session -->|Yes| Page[Allow requested page]
    Session -->|No| Remember{Valid remember-device token?}
    Remember -->|Yes| Restore[Restore session] --> Page
    Remember -->|No| Login[Redirect to login]

    Login --> Choice{Login or self-register?}
    Choice -->|Login| Credentials[Submit username/password]
    Choice -->|Register| Register[Create username/password account]

    Register --> Reserved{Username is reserved admin?}
    Reserved -->|Yes| Block[Reject registration]
    Reserved -->|No| NormalUser[Create normal user account]

    Credentials --> AdminCheck{Username matches built-in admin?}
    AdminCheck -->|Yes| AdminPassword[Validate TRACEAPL_ADMIN_PASSWORD]
    AdminCheck -->|No| UserPassword[Validate stored user password hash]

    AdminPassword --> AdminSession[Admin session]
    UserPassword --> UserSession[User session]

    AdminSession --> AdminRoutes[Admin-only routes allowed]
    UserSession --> UserRoutes[Normal TraceAPL routes allowed]
    UserSession --> AdminDenied[Admin-only routes denied and audited]
